Package: basemapper
Title: Headless Spatial Basemap Renderer
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Pukar", "Bhandari", email = "arpuuuk@gmail.com",
  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Renders styled spatial basemaps headlessly using a Rust core
    (maplibre-rs + wgpu) and exposes the result as raw RGBA pixel arrays to
    R. Integrates with ggplot2 via a lazy GeomBasemap ggproto layer and with
    tmap v4 via tm_basemap().
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust package manager)
Imports:
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4),
    grid,
    sf (>= 1.0),
    jsonlite (>= 1.8)
Suggests:
    roxygen2 (>= 7.3),
    testthat (>= 3.0),
    rextendr (>= 0.3),
    tmap (>= 4.0),
    stars (>= 0.6),
    httr2 (>= 1.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
